---
import type { ServiceGuide } from '../../data/service-guide';
interface Props { service: ServiceGuide }
const { service } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="service-band service-gray" id="situations">
  <div class="container"><p class="service-eyebrow">Common Problems</p><h2>こんなことで、困っていませんか。</h2><div class="service-grid">{service.situations.map(text => <div class="service-card"><p>{text}</p></div>)}</div></div>
</section>
<section class="service-band" id="outcomes">
  <div class="container"><p class="service-eyebrow">What Changes</p><h2>支援を通じて、目指す状態。</h2><div class="service-grid">{service.changes.map(({title,text}) => <article class="service-card"><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div></div>
</section>
<section class="service-band service-gray" id="support">
  <div class="container"><p class="service-eyebrow">How We Work</p><h2>そのために、私たちが支援すること。</h2><div class="service-grid">{service.support.map(({title,text},i) => <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">0{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div>
    {service.slug === 'adoption-growth-support' && <p class="service-foot">営業支援システムの入力・商談管理に絞った支援も含みます。詳しくは<a href="/services/sfa-adoption-support/">SFA定着支援のページ</a>をご覧ください。</p>}
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .service-band { padding: 4rem 0; background: #fff; scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
  .service-gray { background: #F1F5F9; }
  .service-eyebrow { font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--color-navy); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-navy); margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  .service-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .service-card { padding: 1.75rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgb(15 23 42 / .06); }
  h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-navy); margin: 0 0 .75rem; }
  .service-card p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0; }
  .service-number { display: block; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-navy); margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .service-foot { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.9; margin: 1.75rem 0 0; }
  @media(max-width: 800px) { .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .service-band { padding: 3rem 0; } .service-card { padding: 1.5rem; } }
</style>
